>=20
> "za'u [pa] re'u" =3D "not for the first time" =3D "again".

No, that's "for the more than oneth time"; it applies to *every*
time except the first.  I want "nexth" not "greater than oneth".
The second time is {za'u re'u}, but so is the thousandth; it needs
to be relative to whatever the current counter is, and we don't have
a "current number" in PA.

> lo nu za'u re'u broda =3D lo krefu be lo nu broda bei li za'u

.ie .i ku'i mi djica le balvi lamji krefu po'o .e nai ro krefu be fi
le za'u

